      "text": "📄 ONE PAGE · ONE SCREEN · read top ▸ bottom · 🎬 intent first, 📊 status second\n\n═══ 🎛 marquee ══════════ /haipipe-board · spine · close ═══════════\n   S-Main-7                   🔴 OPEN      STAGE      🧠 JL\n\n  🧭 Opening      ❓ the question                    👁 ALWAYS ON STAGE\n       🖱 click the QUESTION, never the heading ──▶ ⬛ flat, no ▸ inside\n             📖 More details · ✍️ Writing Style · 📜 Stage Contract (S)\n  🖼 Diagram      ⬜ shut ──▶ ▧ ASCII ✅ open · ✏️ Excalidraw ⬜ 😴 asleep\n  📚 Content      🗂 ### division ▸ 📄 #### paragraph ▸ ✏️ sentence\n  🎯 Aims         A3.1 · A3.2 · P1               🎬 what SHOULD be true\n  📍 States       ✅ A3.1 · 🔨 A3.2 · 🧠 P1         📊 what IS true\n  📎 Files        ⚙️ engines · 📥 inputs · 📤 outputs\n\n  🏷 every heading:  QB4 / States / Current family    [⧉ copy] [🤖 chat]\n\n═══ 🗃 BELOW THE READ · never taxes the first pass ═════════════════\n  💬 Discussion · ⚖️ Law · 🧠 Lesson · 📖 Glossary · 📜 Log\n  ← QB3               ☰ Index               QB5 →\n\n🚫 unframed: no border · no corners · no card background",
